The purpose of the Company is - both in Italy and abroad - the development, manufacture and marketing of innovative products or services with high technological value and in particular:
- the development, production and marketing of hardware and software solutions and ICT equipment in general;
- the development, production and marketing of hardware and software solutions in the fields of Earth Observation (EO), Internet of Things (loT) and robotics;
- the development, manufacture and ownership of patents or copyrighted intellectual works, whether self-invented or duly acquired from third parties, for the purpose of reselling or leasing the same for consideration or royalties;
- technical assistance, advice and training in relation to the above products carried out by the Company or possibly by third parties, within the framework of the mandatory rules and regulations in force from time to time and after obtaining the necessary authorisations and registration in any registers and/or directories.

