CWNET SRL is an ISP (Internet Service Provide) that provides Internet and telephone services in Italy with the brand &ldquo;Cheapnet&rdquo;.
The company offers broadband internet access services on wired (xDSL, FTTH) and wireless (FWA) technologies. CWNET SRL has developed a proprietary VoIP platform &ldquo;CheapVoIP&rdquo; and, by this service, customers can use a wide range of telephone services by Internet.
Other services provided by CWNET SRL are:
- Hosting for web domain;

- Certified Email;

- Dedicated Server;

- Cloud Services
